~ initialize_local_variables

=> start

~ start
Shopkeeper: [wait=1.0][do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_open")]I see you already got through a few of the objects Micah brought today. Good job.
Shopkeeper: He's a good kid, eh?
- He's definitely something. => eh
- Gets on my nerves, to be honest. => eh
- Yeah. I kind of like him. => like 

~ like 
Shopkeeper: [#sprite=laugh]I'm very glad to hear that. Most people don't. [do Variables.mod_char_var("NPC_4", "relationship", 1)]
Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried]He's had a rough time. His mother died while giving birth, and his dad died himself, recently. 
Shopkeeper: The Elders took him in. He's one of their messengers, now. 
Shopkeeper: But he mostly delivers items to us and back to their owners.
Shopkeeper: Comes here every morning, so you'll be seeing a lot of him. 
Shopkeeper: I'm just glad Sarah has someone her age to hang around with. 
- Sarah seems nice. => nice
- You really care about her, don't you? => nice 

~ eh
